{"mode":"words","text":"Zdaj poslušaj besedilo in hkrati beri z njim. Kot začetnik preberi vrstico z pomenom v svojem maternem jeziku, poslušaj ciljni jezik na počasnem tempu in pogosto pritisni na pavzo – tako bo tvoj um povezal zvok s pomenom. Kot napreden uporabnik bereš izvirno besedilo in le pri neznanih besedah na hitro pogledaš navzdol. Pri tem pogosto uporabi ponovitev A-B: označi posamezen stavek in ga predvajaj v zanki – preizkusi to zgoraj.","words":[{"s":0,"e":160},{"s":240,"e":720},{"s":780,"e":1360},{"s":1493,"e":1760},{"s":1840,"e":2320},{"s":2384,"e":2640},{"s":2680,"e":2720},{"s":2773,"e":3040},{"s":3280,"e":4000},{"s":4053,"e":4720},{"s":4840,"e":5440},{"s":5493,"e":5999},{"s":6000,"e":6001},{"s":6080,"e":6560},{"s":6600,"e":6640},{"s":6700,"e":6960},{"s":7040,"e":7520},{"s":7573,"e":8160},{"s":8360,"e":9360},{"s":9400,"e":9680},{"s":9760,"e":10160},{"s":10213,"e":10320},{"s":10380,"e":10960},{"s":11040,"e":11520},{"s":11760,"e":12240},{"s":12320,"e":12880},{"s":12933,"e":13440},{"s":13493,"e":13600},{"s":13660,"e":14080},{"s":14120,"e":14160},{"s":14368,"e":15200},{"s":15253,"e":15360},{"s":15420,"e":15600},{"s":15680,"e":15840},{"s":15880,"e":16400},{"s":16480,"e":16880},{"s":17040,"e":17200},{"s":17240,"e":18560},{"s":18740,"e":19280},{"s":19340,"e":19840},{"s":19867,"e":20480},{"s":20640,"e":21360},{"s":21413,"e":21840},{"s":21900,"e":22560},{"s":22720,"e":23040},{"s":23093,"e":23200},{"s":23240,"e":23360},{"s":23440,"e":24120},{"s":24150,"e":24640},{"s":24720,"e":24880},{"s":24920,"e":25200},{"s":25240,"e":25600},{"s":25660,"e":26240},{"s":26540,"e":27440},{"s":27480,"e":27600},{"s":27660,"e":28160},{"s":28213,"e":28720},{"s":28760,"e":29360},{"s":29520,"e":30240},{"s":30613,"e":31760},{"s":31820,"e":32400},{"s":32453,"e":32960},{"s":33093,"e":33360},{"s":33387,"e":33440},{"s":33488,"e":34080},{"s":34120,"e":34160},{"s":34240,"e":34800},{"s":35160,"e":35520},{"s":35560,"e":36160},{"s":36213,"e":36320},{"s":36400,"e":36960}]}